      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11991/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir flour and salt together in a large bowl. Add eggs, milk, and butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zfjOafmIZpfi3Us3EFPqLIwuDjs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11991-egg-noodles-Step-02-1-9fe97afafe6c42d1be91a597134d7bc3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11991/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead dough until smooth, about 5 minutes. Let rest in a covered bowl for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B7feFfy14RRL8WsMcqup0yCz744=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11991-egg-noodles-Step-03-1-4354cfb4b4e24bc6be4bff27f638ba29.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11991/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a floured surface, roll dough out to a thickness of 1/8 to 1/4 inch. Cut into desired lengths and shapes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/icUyCs9PcKphapSTJS9bSN_es1I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11991-egg-noodles-Step-05-1-9989de975df94c70841a4b531d36ddae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11991/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Allow to air-dry before cooking, 10 to 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6Vxi_KQCq14hlxUHcCQGUG5IgHo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11991-egg-noodles-Step-07-1-83dd41363cee430ca3aff7b94454165e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11991/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook noodles in a large pot of salted boiling water until al dente, about 5 minutes.",
